@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+## Why
+
+Many visitors only want a board for an afternoon and are turned away because rentals are whole days only.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (non-negative integer euro cents for one hour).
+- A rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour (UTC) is priced at `hourlyPrice` × hours, via `quote` and `book`.
+- An item without an `hourlyPrice` cannot be quoted or booked by the hour (error).
+- Whole-day rentals are unchanged, including the long-stay discount; the discount does not apply to hourly rentals.
+- Hourly bookings take part in the no-overlap rule.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: Equipment registration, the period rules, Quote and Booking gain hourly rental.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: `Equipment` type, `addEquipment`, period parsing and `price`.
+- `src/index.test.ts`: new tests.
